  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Storms are natural phenomena, they provide water for plants and animals, change the shape of the world, and in some cases destroy it. The stormbound learns to emulate these aspects in the form of Storm Powers. At 1st level, and every 2 levels thereafter, the stormbound may select a single storm power that they qualify for. The list of storm powers available to the stormbound is located below.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/stormbound#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
